$date 2026-11-12T10:39:07 $end
$version fda debug_core (brief 50A) $end
$comment Trigger on the rising edge of rx_valid when the received byte rx_data is 0xA5, and show rx_data and the raw UART receive line, 900 cycles before and 100 after. Make it happen by reading SCRATCH. $end
$timescale 10000 ps $end
$scope module capture $end
$var wire 1 ! rx_valid $end
$var wire 8 " rx_data $end
$var wire 1 # uart_rx_pin $end
$var wire 1 $ TRIGGER $end
$upscope $end
$enddefinitions $end
